{"id":"H0476","lemma":"אֱלִישָׁמָע","transliteration":"elishama","sayIt":"e-li-sha-MA","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Elishama","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Num.1.10;\nson of: Ammihud (H5989);\nfather of: Nun (H5126)\n§ Elishama = \"my God has heard\"\n1) an Ephraimite chief in the wilderness\n2) a son of David\n3) Jehoiakim's secretary\n4) a priest who taught the law\n5) a man of Judah","glosses":["elishama","elishua"],"count":17,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-1","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"num-2","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"is Elishama","kjv":"shall be Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"num-7","v":48,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"num-7","v":53,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elishama","kjv":"of Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"num-10","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"with Elishama","kjv":"was Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-5","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"And Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-25","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"of Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishua","kjv":"and Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"And Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-14","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"And Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-17","v":8,"renderings":{"kjv":"and with them Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"jer-36","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elishama","kjv":"even Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"jer-36","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elishama","kjv":"of Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"jer-36","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elishama","kjv":"it out of Elishama"}},{"chapterId":"jer-41","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elishama","kjv":"of Elishama"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 1:10","note":"Of the children of Joseph: of Ephraim: Elishama the son of Ammihud; of Manasseh: Gamaliel the son of Pedahzur.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 5:16","note":"Elishama, Eliada, and Eliphelet.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Kings 25:25","note":"But in the seventh month, Ishmael the son of Nethaniah, the son of Elishama, of the royal offspring came, and ten men with him, and struck Gedaliah, so that he…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:41","note":"and Shallum became the father of Jekamiah, and Jekamiah became the father of Elishama.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Chronicles 17:8","note":"and with them the Levites, even Shemaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah, and Tobadonijah, the Levites; and with them…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 36:12","note":"he went down into the king’s house, into the scribe’s room: and behold, all the princes were sitting there, Elishama the scribe, Delaiah the son of Shemaiah…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0467","lemma":"אֲלִיפֶ֫לֶט","transliteration":"eliphelet","gloss":"Eliphelet"},{"id":"H0474","lemma":"אֱלִישׁוּעַ","transliteration":"elishua","gloss":"Elishua"},{"id":"H0053","lemma":"אֲבִישָׁלוֹם","transliteration":"avishalom","gloss":"Absalom"},{"id":"H0138","lemma":"אֲדֹנִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"adoniyyah","gloss":"Adonijah"},{"id":"H0450","lemma":"אֶלְיָדָע","transliteration":"elyada","gloss":"Eliada"},{"id":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","transliteration":"david","gloss":"David"},{"id":"H0550","lemma":"אַמְנוֹן","transliteration":"amnon","gloss":"Amnon"},{"id":"H3609","lemma":"כִּלְאָב","transliteration":"kilav","gloss":"Chileab"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0476H","gloss":"Elishama","relation":"H0476H ="},{"id":"H0476I","gloss":"Elishama","relation":"H0476I ="},{"id":"H0476J","gloss":"Elishama","relation":"H0476J ="},{"id":"H0476K","gloss":"Elishama","relation":"H0476K ="},{"id":"H0476L","gloss":"Elishama","relation":"H0476L ="},{"id":"H0476M","gloss":"Elishama","relation":"H0476M = a Name of"}],"sources":[